 "Q2_BL7_verdict": "BL7 IS READING-DEPENDENT: it does NOT arise under COV-EQV.  Every interface-surviving recipe intertwines, so under the landed Cycle-856 reading of covariance there is no conflict between covariance and the gravity interface at all, and Cycle 906's M6 becomes ONE OF TWO lawful resolutions",
 "Q2_cov_eqv_form": "a weighting FAMILY {w_m}_{m in Z_11}, w_m defined on the phase-m event space, satisfies COV-EQV iff     w_m(g.e) = w_{(m+g) mod 11}(e) for every g, m in Z_11 and every realized event e.  On the F_WORLD pushforward this reads W_m(sigma_g(w)) = W_{(m+g) mod 11}(w) for every world w -- the same identity Cycle 856 states for stamp sets, with 'stamped' replaced by 'carries mass'",
